WEBVTT

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:10.590
The following program is intended for mature audiences
and contains Adult Content, Graphic Language,

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:14.760
Graphic Violence,
Brief Nudity and Strong Sexual Content including rape.

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:20.810
And so the chances of us
teaming up with you all are zero.

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:24.520
If you were going to wound him,
you should've killed Shira.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.730
I also can't trust people
who would keep someone like that.

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:31.440
I will say that his company was something
we acquired unintentionally,

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:34.200
but I suppose there's no helping it.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:39.160
So Giichi said he's found him,

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:41.290
Kagehisa Anotsu.

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:43.120
His destination in Kaga,

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:47.000
it seems little Rin is on her way over there, huh?

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:02.640
BLADE OF THE IMMORTAL

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:05.060
One, two, three

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:10.020
Undead tree

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:11.780
What truth

00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:15.570
I'll come true

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:20.410
Wow, wow, wow, wow

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:26.670
And I see that bright light

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:33.510
This is all I have

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:35.510
What did you say?

00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:38.050
I know

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:41.930
Why do you say?

00:01:43.430 --> 00:01:47.560
Hone the blade lie around

00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:50.860
Survive of vision

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:54.650
Death and pleasure are my future

00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:58.860
I got lost, I was lost

00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:02.410
Survive of vision

00:02:02.490 --> 00:02:05.910
Unfinished heaven

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.710
Now fight to claim your wounds

00:02:09.790 --> 00:02:13.800
Don't know why, don't know why

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:18.260
Survive of vision

00:02:25.850 --> 00:02:30.730
So I know where he is, but chasing him
would mean skipping the gate.

00:02:33.070 --> 00:02:33.980
Sorry.

00:02:34.070 --> 00:02:35.480
Likewise.

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:39.450
You're...

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:41.120
Aren't you...?

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:44.120
Where's Rin?

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:48.080
About that...

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:50.920
She went to Kaga to take her revenge.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.790
Why didn't you go with her?

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:57.260
Really now, sir? You really think
a guy like me has an entry pass?

00:02:57.340 --> 00:02:58.920
Entry pass?

00:02:59.010 --> 00:03:01.510
I can get any number of those for you.

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:04.180
Of course.

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:07.600
As long as you're not a criminal,
anyone can get one, if they ask.

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:13.900
Why are you here?

00:03:13.980 --> 00:03:15.860
That's what I'd like to know.

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:31.540
Now, now, no horseplay.

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:33.380
-Horseplay? Who the--?
-So...

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:34.500
What are you doing?

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:37.250
All the better if you're acquaintances.

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:39.760
If he could help you with your search--

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:41.470
Why do I have to help him?

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:45.930
Well, because I thought just handing you
an entry pass would be boring.

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:47.510
What?

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:48.720
Give me that.

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:53.440
Isn't this Shira?

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:55.270
What? You...?

00:03:56.980 --> 00:04:00.570
How can Edo be so vast, yet so small?

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:06.870
Is that next?

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:12.040
Yeah.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:17.590
So, Hyaku,

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:20.460
we might want to return to headquarters soon.

00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:22.760
See, I've been thinking.

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:25.140
The reason it feels like nothing's going well lately

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:27.890
is that aiming straight towards
the leader of the Itto-ryu

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:29.640
might be too big a responsibility.

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:34.440
Hyakurin, I doubt you've forgotten,

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:38.730
but if the two of us pay our 100 ryo fine,
we'll be off the hook.

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:40.690
Even at one-and-a-half ryo per head,

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:44.780
we'd have to kill three people a month
to have it paid in two years.

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:50.080
In the Mugai-ryu, we'll never have to worry
about food and never get bored,

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:52.370
but at this rate, we're living as murderers.

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:56.500
The sun keeps telling me to do otherwise.

00:04:57.580 --> 00:04:58.670
That is true.

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:03.300
So, Hyaku, I've got a proposal for you.

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:06.510
Actually, let's just say it was something
I thought was a good idea.

00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:10.720
So this would all be two years from now,

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:13.020
but assuming we get back our freedom,

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:15.190
we're both broke, right?

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:18.400
We've got no family or relatives depending on us,

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:22.280
so I thought the two of us could-- Could--

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:24.190
Could take up a--

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:27.490
Or-- Or-- Or rather, start a household.

00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:29.910
-Ew.
-It was a joke, I swear.

00:05:29.990 --> 00:05:31.830
I was lying. I'm sorry.

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:35.120
You wouldn't want that. "Ew" was accurate.

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:38.080
Hm?

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:39.540
A fly.

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:43.760
Sorry, what were you just saying?

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:49.470
Oh, just that if you don't eat eel
once in a while, you're hardly even living.

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:07.610
We thought you died on the road.

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:10.490
Where did you go?

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:14.160
Where's Giichi?

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:15.540
He's not here today.

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:19.250
I see. He's not here, huh?

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:23.340
In this operation,

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:27.670
you two were patrolling the main road to Kyoto, right?

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:28.800
Yes.

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:31.390
Did you confirm all the dead?

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:32.510
Of course.

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:36.310
Although, I did hear that one lived.

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:37.230
What of it?

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:41.730
I'll give you some valuable information.

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:46.860
Letting someone escape
after they've memorized your face

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:49.570
is something a professional just doesn't do.

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:53.080
If you wound an animal,

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:56.790
it will certainly return to bring you calamity.

00:06:58.210 --> 00:07:01.460
It almost seems as if you're referring to yourself.

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:06.590
Well then...

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:10.800
If we're all still alive, I'll be back.

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:13.180
So, what, you won't wait for Giichi?

00:07:14.430 --> 00:07:16.390
No, that's okay.

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:18.350
It's better he's not here anyway.

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:26.280
Shinriji, get ready. We're heading out immediately.

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:28.280
Right.

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:50.260
Hey, lady.

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:53.470
I wonder if you remember my face.

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:58.560
I'm the small-fry swordsman you stabbed to death
from far away with your needles.

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:02.310
Thanks to you, I can't move two of my fingers.

00:08:02.390 --> 00:08:05.020
On top of that, my left eye is in this sorry state.

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:09.320
You won't get off easily with a swift death.

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:10.650
Search the inside.

00:08:10.740 --> 00:08:13.110
There should be at least one more young guy here.

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:16.160
I thought I just saw a shadow on the second floor.

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:17.780
Hey, up there.

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:19.120
Really?

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:21.580
Wait, who are you?

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:25.920
-Hyaku!
-Get away, Shinriji!

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:28.500
These guys are Itto-ryu. You're no match.

00:08:28.590 --> 00:08:29.710
Hyaku!

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:31.260
This little amateur--

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:34.550
Sorry.

00:08:36.850 --> 00:08:37.680
Hyaku!

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:55.990
Come. We're leaving.

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:04.790
I don't know a single thing about you,
but you've proven reliable.

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:06.250
My thanks.

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:07.460
Don't mention it.

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:11.420
You see, this plain old piece of paper

00:09:11.510 --> 00:09:14.760
is the scarcest of treasures for a guy like me.

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:27.350
So you got beaten up by the guy
you were supposed to beat up,

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:29.560
and now you're acting like an underling?

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:32.070
It's not like that.

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:35.450
That teacher claims to know nothing
about the guy on the paper,

00:09:35.530 --> 00:09:37.990
but his vibe said otherwise.

00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:42.580
So I thought he might let his motive slip
if I spent a while here like an underling.

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:44.870
That's when you appeared.

00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:48.330
Mr. Manji.

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:52.090
There sure are people in this world
who make you want to vomit.

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:56.260
She was just your average whore
with no status or power.

00:09:56.340 --> 00:10:00.970
That thought didn't even enter his head,
and now he's living without a care.

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:08.940
If it hadn't been my girl that got killed,
I probably wouldn't have felt so strongly.

00:10:10.150 --> 00:10:13.400
But people like him were scattered in the Itto-ryu too.

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:19.110
You're getting on my nerves, idiot.

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:23.790
I swear, my head gets so itchy
when I see kids like you.

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:25.370
It's as if...

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:31.130
Magatsu...

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:32.630
want to come with me?

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:40.760
You'll be able to appease the restless ghost
of that girl you were on about,

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:42.220
Taito Magatsu.

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:10.790
Get her down. I'm tired of beating her up.

00:11:17.960 --> 00:11:20.470
Looks like you've still got some willpower left.

00:11:20.550 --> 00:11:22.970
But it really is unfathomable.

00:11:23.050 --> 00:11:25.930
In your organization,
you just throw your lives away for honor?

00:11:26.010 --> 00:11:29.770
Just tell me already,
and things will get much easier. Yeah?

00:11:38.610 --> 00:11:40.990
The sweet smell of cooking flesh.

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:44.830
And we can't forget to season it while it's hot.

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:49.790
This red powder here is chili pepper.

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:52.170
It'll prevent you from bleeding.

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:05.010
Woman, tell us now.

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:09.770
Previously, when Taito Magatsu killed your allies
during their attempt at vengeance,

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:12.190
we are told they uttered the name "Akagi."

00:12:13.190 --> 00:12:19.650
All things we will come to know eventually,
but if you don't talk, we will kill you here.

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:22.280
"Akagi," that given name...

00:12:23.410 --> 00:12:24.660
do you have other allies?

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:36.330
If it's Akagi you wants,
he appeared before you some time ago.

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:39.050
It went completely over your head,

00:12:39.130 --> 00:12:41.760
and now you guys are wasting time here,
sitting around.

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:43.720
He's going to kill you all.

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:57.110
I think the others will be back soon.

00:12:58.110 --> 00:12:59.020
Sorry.

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:05.910
Your mother sure is a rare one.

00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:08.280
You don't see many natural blonds.

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:14.160
My mom was the child of a foreigner's mistress,
so her eyes were blue too.

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:17.830
She was of questionable lineage,
and with her appearance...

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:20.420
she couldn't find a proper job.

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:26.590
And dealing with me as a newborn
left her scraping to get by every single day.

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:31.720
If I were a respectable person,
I could have made life easier for her.

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:35.310
What's she doing now?

00:13:35.390 --> 00:13:37.980
Actually, she passed a year ago.

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:42.280
So, while your ages are different,
when I look at you, your hair,

00:13:42.360 --> 00:13:45.700
and that listless manner of speaking,
just seem to...

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:49.990
But this time I'll be able to really work.

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:54.450
I couldn't while she was alive,
but I intend to show some filial piety now.

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:03.050
He said "let's start a household"

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:07.260
to the woman he was using
as a replacement for his mother.

00:14:08.640 --> 00:14:10.550
What a pointless man.

00:14:12.060 --> 00:14:13.720
Hey, what are you doing?

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:17.190
She just looked like she was having a laugh.

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:23.440
Shinriji... you're still alive, aren't you?

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:28.070
You can't just quietly go and report to your mother

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:32.120
when the woman you love
hasn't given you a reply yet.

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:36.540
It's cool out.

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:40.790
I'm surprised I'm sane
being cooped up in that shed all day.

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:44.630
Who are you?

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:47.550
I have something to ask you.

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:53.640
You're one of the men who attacked
the bathhouse in Kodenmacho two days ago.

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:58.020
The dead man's finger was pointing to the southeast.

00:14:58.100 --> 00:14:59.100
You understand?

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:00.150
Southeast.

00:15:01.150 --> 00:15:06.110
Between the geisha district and the lumberyard,
the lumberyard is more conducive to privacy.

00:15:06.190 --> 00:15:09.570
Then, there are three different scents
emanating from you.

00:15:09.650 --> 00:15:13.200
The smell of blood, the sour smell
of having slept with a woman--

00:15:13.280 --> 00:15:16.080
This is the red-light district. Of course I--

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:20.960
Third, that woman uses a southern formula
to remove the color from her hair.

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:24.500
Thanks to that, her hair smells of particular chemicals.

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:29.380
That scent would certainly linger if you had
perhaps slept with her numerous times.

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:39.810
-What is that? Tojo, hurry.
-I can't stop--

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:43.650
What was that?

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:48.230
-Taking a leak?
-Something like that.

00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:51.280
You'll be alone for a bit. Watch the woman.

00:16:52.010 --> 00:16:53.300
Was that...?

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:54.260
No way.

00:16:58.510 --> 00:16:59.930
Kinuka.

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:02.480
Stay back.

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:04.440
You got it, buddy?

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:07.980
I can get inside and stick a blade
in the sleeping girl's chest

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:10.150
quicker than you can take my head.

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:14.450
You see how this works? Now, how about you...?

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:26.790
Curses.

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:28.210
All the better.

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:35.010
I've had enough.

00:17:40.050 --> 00:17:43.350
You must be joking, you scum!

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:53.320
Matsuhiko...

00:17:55.320 --> 00:17:56.910
How pitiful did Father find me,

00:17:56.990 --> 00:18:02.830
after learning I lashed out against the ones teasing me
for being born sickly and being feminine,

00:18:02.910 --> 00:18:06.870
only to be beaten by them instead?

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:12.420
If Father would make me strong,
I would gladly devote myself to it.

00:18:13.460 --> 00:18:17.680
It's been 10 years since my father,
retained by Lord Ieharu,

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:21.180
and praised as "the top three instructors
in the capital," died.

00:18:21.260 --> 00:18:25.930
How can we begin to understand this family disaster
by which our dojo was shut down

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:28.730
and we are left unable to even employ our servants?

00:18:29.810 --> 00:18:35.990
Ever since you cast aside Matsuhiko's twin sister
eight years ago without even naming her,

00:18:36.070 --> 00:18:38.030
saying "women are useless,"

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:42.620
I remained patient for Matushiko's sake.

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:47.290
Do you intend to reduce his body to nothing as well?

00:18:47.370 --> 00:18:51.460
If the dojo would otherwise fail
and the Hayakawa family crumble away,

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:54.630
I'm more than happy to go to extremes now.

00:18:54.710 --> 00:18:56.380
Dear.

00:18:56.460 --> 00:18:59.550
What you lack is strength.

00:18:59.630 --> 00:19:02.430
If you are unable to swing that 100 times,

00:19:02.510 --> 00:19:05.970
you will certainly never be able
to swing a sword freely.

00:19:06.060 --> 00:19:11.480
This is too far. What child has ever had to swing
an 8-and-a-half kan wooden sword 100 times?

00:19:11.560 --> 00:19:14.110
-What's worse, the child--
-I'll do it, Mother.

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:28.250
Matsuhiko. Dear.

00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:30.210
He's coughing up blood. That's enough.

00:19:30.290 --> 00:19:33.040
Matsuhiko, steel yourself.

00:19:43.930 --> 00:19:46.430
Hyaku, I'll need you to birth another.

00:19:52.480 --> 00:19:54.190
My child's blood...

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:01.650
My child's blood won't...

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:04.370
come off.

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:09.200
The blood, my child's...

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:14.500
Age 26. Is there anything you'd like to say?

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:18.960
Was this the plan for me and my child all along?

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:23.090
Why?

00:20:23.180 --> 00:20:26.260
Why am I here?

00:20:26.350 --> 00:20:28.890
Have I done something wrong?

00:20:37.020 --> 00:20:38.780
Dreams of your child again?

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:41.820
Yes.

00:20:41.900 --> 00:20:44.030
And of you.

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:49.290
You were asleep for three whole days.

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:53.460
Apologies, but I cleaned your clothes for you.

00:20:53.540 --> 00:20:55.670
I'm sure I smelled awful.

00:20:56.750 --> 00:20:57.960
What about Shinriji?

00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:01.420
I buried him out behind the Inari shrine.

00:21:02.670 --> 00:21:03.510
I see.

00:21:05.470 --> 00:21:06.800
This is a tragedy.

00:21:09.600 --> 00:21:11.810
I slipped up a bit.

00:21:17.020 --> 00:21:20.150
What do we do from here?

00:21:20.230 --> 00:21:23.400
I've reported everything to our superiors.

00:21:23.490 --> 00:21:24.650
Including about Shira.

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:27.740
Orders will come eventually.

00:21:27.820 --> 00:21:31.490
Well, for now, just focus on
getting your body back to normal.

00:21:33.410 --> 00:21:34.410
Giichi...

00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:36.750
